Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john",
  "email": "john@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### Public API
GET http://localhost:8080/hello

###

### Create Room (Protected)
POST http://localhost:8080/room/create?hostId=1&maxPlayers=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Start Game (Protected)
POST http://localhost:8080/game/start?roomCode=0086E0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Game (Protected)
GET http://localhost:8080/game/0086E0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Next Phase (Protected)
PUT http://localhost:8080/game/next?roomCode=0086E0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### End Game (Protected)
PUT http://localhost:8080/game/end?roomCode=0086E0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Add Host Player (Protected)
POST http://localhost:8080/player/add?userId=1&roomCode=0086E0&host=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Add Second Player (Protected)
POST http://localhost:8080/player/add?userId=2&roomCode=0086E0&host=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Players (Protected)
GET http://localhost:8080/player/0086E0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Duplicate Register
POST http://localhost:8080/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john",
  "email": "john@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### Wrong Password
POST http://localhost:8080/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@gmail.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### User Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abc@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### Validation Test
POST http://localhost:8080/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "123"
}

###

### Protected API WITHOUT Token (Should return 401)
GET http://localhost:8080/game/0086E0

###

### Protected API WITH Token (Should return 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/game/0086E0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

